<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Desi Bouterse</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1945">1945</a>–<a href="/years/2024">2024</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Desi Bouterse was a Surinamese soldier and politician who seized power in a coup in February 1980 and ruled as military strongman through the 1980s. His regime carried out the December murders of 1982, in which fifteen opponents were killed, and fought the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jungle-commando">Jungle Commando</a> in the interior war of 1986–1992. Elected president in 2010, he served until 2020 and was later convicted for the 1982 murders.</p></div>
